    <p>Arrows is a slide-and-extract game at heart: read the empty space, commit, and let the board collapse cleanly. GridPaw's browser puzzles train the same muscles — free, no download, no signup:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><a href="/">Shikaku</a> — partition the grid into numbered rectangles; the same "read the whole board before you commit" discipline, and the same calm, one-solution logic.</li>
